   "end_sec": 6.793,
   "duration_sec": 6.793
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C56-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "はい。資料の結果を報告します。週に三日以上使った人は、八人から十二人になりました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C56-D002-S01",
    "C56-D002-S02",
    "C56-D002-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 7.143,
   "end_sec": 14.966,
   "duration_sec": 7.823
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C56-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "割合は四十パーセントから六十パーセントですね。「二十パーセント増えた」と書いてもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C56-D003-S01",
    "C56-D003-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "low_ASR_text_match"
   ],
   "start_sec": 15.316,
   "end_sec": 20.934,
   "duration_sec": 5.618
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C56-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "差は二十ポイントです。増えた二十は元の四十の半分なので、五十パーセント増えたと言えます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C56-D004-S01",
    "C56-D004-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 21.284,
   "end_sec": 28.416,
   "duration_sec": 7.132
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C56-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "つまり、割合は元の一・五倍ですね。対象が同じ二十人だということも、説明に入れましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C56-D005-S01",
    "C56-D005-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 28.766,
   "end_sec": 35.684,
   "duration_sec": 6.918
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C56-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "そうですね。一回の利用時間も長くなったんでしょうか。通常の週の平均は六十分と書いてありますが。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C56-D006-S01",
    "C56-D006-S02",
    "C56-D006-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 36.034,
   "end_sec": 43.852,
   "duration_sec": 7.818
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C56-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "それは実際に使った十五人の一回の平均です。試行の週の平均はないので、比べられません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C56-D007-S01",
    "C56-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 44.202,
   "end_sec": 51.277,
   "duration_sec": 7.075
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C56-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "では、今の情報だけで長く続けると決めるのは早いですね。でも、この資料には意味があるんですよね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C56-D008-S01",
    "C56-D008-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 51.627,
   "end_sec": 59.116,
   "duration_sec": 7.489
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C56-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "もちろんです。この二十人の変化は分かります。ただ、原因や全体の希望までは分かりません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C56-D009-S01",
    "C56-D009-S02",
    "C56-D009-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 59.466,
   "end_sec": 66.295,
   "duration_sec": 6.829
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C56-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "参加しなかった人にも意見を聞きましょう。担当者に問い合わせて、伺う日程を相談するのは私が担当します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C56-D010-S01",
    "C56-D010-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 66.645,
   "end_sec": 74.473,
   "duration_sec": 7.828
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C56-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "頼まれた人が断りにくいと思わないように、参加は自由だと説明しておくべきですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C56-D011-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
